---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Work & Money Math"
  description="Privacy policy for Work & Money Math. Client-side calculators; minimal data collection."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="prose panel">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 18 September 2026 (AEST).</p>
    <h2>Calculators</h2>
    <p>
      Calculator inputs are processed in your browser. This MVP does not send your numbers to a backend to
      compute results.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting &amp; logs</h2>
    <p>
      The static site may be hosted on Cloudflare Pages or similar. Hosts typically collect standard request
      logs (IP, user agent, URL) for security and reliability.
    </p>
    <h2>Theme preference</h2>
    <p>
      If you use the theme toggle, a preference may be stored in <code>localStorage</code> on your device only.
    </p>
    <h2>Future analytics / ads</h2>
    <p>
      We may add privacy-friendly analytics or ads later. If we do, this page will be updated to describe what
      is collected. Affiliate links, when added, will be disclosed.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions about this project, use the contact channel listed on the live site once it is
      published.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
